{
  "duration": 41.119,
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.099,
      "end": 0.239,
      "text": "So"
    },
    {
      "start": 0.699,
      "end": 1.74,
      "text": "welcome back again."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.46,
      "end": 3.399,
      "text": "It's time to solve"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.98,
      "end": 4.859,
      "text": "one more problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.5,
      "end": 6.759,
      "text": "Now in this problem, we are given"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.219,
      "end": 8.979,
      "text": "sine 30 degrees and cos"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.42,
      "end": 10.039,
      "text": "60 degrees."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.619,
      "end": 11.359,
      "text": "The question is"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.779,
      "end": 13.079,
      "text": "asking us to find their sum."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.739,
      "end": 13.899,
      "text": "Now,"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.199,
      "end": 17.199,
      "text": "the important point here is that these are standard trigonometric values."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.719,
      "end": 20.34,
      "text": "We should remember them because they are used very often."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.859,
      "end": 22.84,
      "text": "Sine 30 degree is equal to one by two,"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.359,
      "end": 26.379,
      "text": "and cos 60 degree is also equal to one by two."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.139,
      "end": 28.439,
      "text": "Now that we know both values,"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.819,
      "end": 33.439,
      "text": "let us substitute them into the given expression. So we get one half plus one half,"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.2,
      "end": 35.299,
      "text": "which is equal to one."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.919,
      "end": 36.119,
      "text": "Done."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.579,
      "end": 37.86,
      "text": "So the final answer will be one."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.7,
      "end": 41.119,
      "text": "Hence, the correct option is option B."
    }
  ],
